        "content": "## Morning brief, 07:00 weekdays\nCalendar + unread mail -> JSON files -> `python -m jarvis.morning_brief` (weather, to-dos, tickets, paper portfolio) -> mailed to yourself.\n\nSet your address in the last node.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 170,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "11ddac09-47bd-58f6-989b-c427c22522fd",
      "name": "07:00 weekdays",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -560,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
